voicebot_decoy.npy: 4 s of one utterance of LibriTTS-R (train-clean-100), 16 kHz,
16-bit PCM, scaled to a peak of half of full scale. The voice isolator's voicebot
mode tells the model to keep this voice, which is in no call, until the caller is
enrolled.

LibriTTS-R: Yuma Koizumi, Heiga Zen, Shigeki Karita, Yifan Ding, Kohei Yatabe,
Nobuyuki Morioka, Michiel Bacchiani, Yu Zhang, Wei Han, Ankur Bapna, "LibriTTS-R:
A Restored Multi-Speaker Text-to-Speech Corpus", Interspeech 2023.
https://www.openslr.org/141/

